{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡首揭創業黑歷史曾問母借錢  拍檔反枱半年極速倒閉  反鎖家中情緒崩潰不吃不喝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ce4207360d6fda66e17a733c0ba88e0/2026-10/KF_0_31.jpg\"/>\n<p>TVB節目《流行都市》主持宋芝齡瓣數多多，經營不少生意，有指其身家豐厚，被冠以「隱形富婆」稱號。宋芝齡近日在其YouTube頻道《宋芝齡 AdriannaSUNG》上，自揭創業路並非一帆風順，剖白初次搞生意時曾遭遇滑鐵盧，一度大受打擊而絕食三日。</p>\n<h2>宋芝齡從小立志做商人</h2>\n<p>宋芝齡近日在其頻道透露，自幼便對商業書籍及創業故事充滿憧憬，早在參選香港小姐時，已立志要做成功的商人。後來宋芝齡憑藉其中韓混血兒的背景，敏銳地察覺到韓流時裝在香港的龐大商機。正巧當時有心儀地段的舖位招租，宋芝齡便向韓籍母親借數萬元，聯同幾位好友合資，開設人生第一間韓國時裝專門店。</p>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡是中韓混血兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/80dcb6a4879582ffe5f260cb09bd6b85/2024-07/xazq_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡曾在韓國讀書。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18af8a829984890772251408c7bbc2d9/2024-07/01a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡於2009年開辦韓文教育課程。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/126979708934e5f23a14a8b4923a7145/2024-07/DSC_6907.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋之齡開辦韓語學校發展不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/88b7508ed04269a8b8aa60a321348c84/2024-07/DSC_6949.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡開辦韓國投資移民生意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0b559e1014c52559bc2e6470906b17a6/2024-07/152.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡涉獵多方面與韓國有關的業務。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d1aaeda7bc145b517f4bc5c3b6bcda61/2024-07/133.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡經營小學補習學校。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/568c26713e1f386c33f1a61b3781fdf7/2024-07/001_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡瓣數多多，經營不少生意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbbf7b9551680b4a8f80384ca2b80f91/2024-07/002_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡近日在其YouTube頻道《宋芝齡 AdriannaSUNG》上，自揭創業路並非一帆風順。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/059983591b91d5360e2d0e0be1a71bb7/2026-10/Song_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡表示初次搞生意時，曾問母親借數萬元，與幾位朋友合資。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e30e9e6d7f17f06eb783d06a7f5ce8a2/2026-10/Song_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡原以為親力親為，每日賺幾千元，大家開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4082f08dfdc1e65c4d7559963e20a9d0/2026-10/Song_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"時裝店經營不到半年，宋芝齡因與合夥人的營運方針出現嚴重分歧，最終結業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acd937a926e84c82dc65babba7b1c52c/2026-10/Song_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡一度大受打擊：「衝擊到我喺屋企攤咗喺床上三日三夜。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/124423bfa5729b9c7dd518df903d7f3d/2026-10/Song_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡5歲時隨家人由韓國移居香港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/25e10ed9d4a0b7607be63f38bd37fae8/2023-09/DSC00664.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡早前返韓國探親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8f52a6607a022f2d023d2da76f38674/2022-12/songig_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡曾返韓國深親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5dfd3ea9169c0ea18f08f4ce42cdfe1/2022-12/songig_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡和媽咪關係很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36f90105de3f16ffa6360fcdce1aff86/2024-07/sungchihling_1717998957_3387143212622590796_465344938.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"身為韓國通的宋芝齡，曾訪問李英愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4068b1d8461cec540902088027417d24/2023-02/XAZI_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡早年亦訪問過池珍熙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e41d8ec46acdd3a978c6e54f9987e697/2023-02/xazl_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡曾為灣仔西分區委員會委員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a6d3c0a0f03582ba99affa6e5ff6a9a/2023-08/343085419_802506751501684_6660680830465467511_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡積極參與地區工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e671433bc3b796bf3b80ca476d29b5cd/2023-08/345237661_6023069371112211_9056293522292402565_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡曾擺街站。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdd334e31ad6e689d08af951b011b91e/2023-08/348573882_160969936739583_7930767755028720098_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡落區宣傳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93e6347997d33f99ae3ac2d8aca3da6f/2023-08/352832068_626407962884439_867546836041343282_n.jpg\"/>\n<h2>宋芝齡跟拍檔意見分歧</h2>\n<p>可惜理想與現實總有落差，宋芝齡回憶起當年的自己，直言想法「太過天真」，誤以為只要店舖、貨源和資金到位，因初期的營業額達到「一日都有5000幾，最差都有2000幾」，以為一切順利。豈料時裝店經營不到半年，宋芝齡因與合夥人的營運方針出現嚴重分歧，最終結業。</p>\n<p>宋芝齡形容當時的感覺，有如「整個世界都塌了下來」，店舖倒閉後，宋芝齡一度心灰意冷將自己反鎖在家中：「衝擊到我喺屋企攤咗喺床上三日三夜，嚴重到飯都冇食」，幸而在第三天宋芝齡終於想通，決定不能再消沉重新振作：「起身煮個辛辣麵，先照顧好自己。」</p>\n<h2>宋芝齡生意瓣數多</h2>\n<p>宋芝齡在片中表示經歷過該次教訓，領悟到世上並無絕路，失敗往往是另一個新起點的契機。如今回想起來，已是微不足道的小事，亦是人生中最寶貴的養分。宋芝齡於千禧年代曾與友人合辦韓流報章，從2008年起與人合資開辦韓語學校，其後又涉獵韓國投資移民生意。宋芝齡又曾開設婚紗攝影公司，宋芝齡之後再開設韓式小食店，惟兩店均已結業。</p>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡是圈中出名的「韓國通」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2bc3ff4cddaf442bab642bfc4793af41/2024-07/sungchihling_1714797316_3360285900024876215_465344938.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡愛犬身價不菲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f02cbf5f0b1d3ad4fdf81a8b1ab4a38e/2024-07/sungchihling_1713741833_3351431869999409748_465344938.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡與安德尊的緋聞傳過不停。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ff4f12714cc8fcb36acd0b9abafab96/2023-08/367737827_708629167750007_1243698960725471422_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安德尊與宋芝齡合作婦女節目多年，成為好朋友，更傳出緋聞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e6a52a8b9c3f6b20fe920c415e69c8e/2022-12/songig_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡與安德尊曾拍片拜堂結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30ddbcd2e1f214c9a86b7d6e8c258169/2024-07/13_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡與安德尊試過被安排拜堂結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b86e0d853391161192ff880453d45801/2023-10/KING_mp4_snapshot_00_06_160.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡與安德尊跟足傳統習俗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a9665c865441a287345fd273d71d537/2023-10/KING_mp4_snapshot_00_19_048.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡與安德尊在「老爺、奶奶」面前拜過堂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/793e2a747cc306e63ba7e75883b8eaec/2023-10/KING_mp4_snapshot_00_33_275.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡與安德尊表現相當甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b048aff6254ba3726567fb7389d57f7f/2023-10/KING_mp4_snapshot_00_40_881.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安德尊與宋芝齡又互相撕殺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8901d0eeafeb6243bc0b753236166e1/2023-10/KING_mp4_snapshot_01_05_487.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安德尊與宋芝齡表現好自然。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fa52ff8e65c4160d78356c2caa98316/2023-10/KING_mp4_snapshot_02_20_492.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安德尊試過在62歲的生日會上將宋芝齡夾到實。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15dfbf38a25c07d410e8fb9bc3e1f70d/2023-09/song_33.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡被安德尊攬在懷中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99813198fd863d76e60823a0bb5d954b/2023-09/song_31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡和安德尊公然耍花槍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37280c59e2329ca623a3ed1b7107d8c9/2023-09/song_40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡與安德尊打情罵俏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54f0d669dc21b931253b071cf3262885/2023-09/song_53.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡全程在安德尊旁邊，儼如「女主人」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/148fcf7483b9eb11cb3c0daa199303d3/2023-09/380377361_341758738193856_7965706007281666736_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安德尊早前自爆經宋芝齡介紹下，在韓國買山投資，認真誇張。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/450d9330767d32aa8f5e5e22aa874626/2022-12/13_42.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡與安德尊如一對歡喜冤家，經常鬥嘴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f6213438620f9339dcf7756fce086b7/2022-12/14_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安德尊與宋芝齡感情好到傳出緋聞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1aef84c1b67a8e6d6e496b74b0f9c72/2022-12/ansong_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安德尊與宋芝齡受訪時澄清緋聞，卻在鏡頭前打情罵俏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ab89476bae4abb693b2379de697181d/2022-12/ansong_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"宋芝齡還靠在安德尊的身上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f2a25267158d4ef8c420638b52c95d7/2023-09/videoplayback_mp4_snapshot_01_45_242.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T09:02:27.911585+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":726,"images":45,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:00:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:58:30.794870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:43.664231+00:00","content_hash":"ff32f3000dddcd0337e2ffcf6b3dcc5fc312c1b97fa1b7e2a1bef5cb05ccb37c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}